# Testing, Validation, and Reporting Rules

Do not claim a check passed unless it actually ran.

Run the most relevant available checks for the changed area.

For Unity Phase 8B quiz UI, run or perform:

Unity compilation
Console review
scene reference checks
UI Toolkit UIDocument checks
PanelSettings checks
USS/UXML reference checks
safe area checks
Android landscape layout checks
touch target checks
quiz navigation checks
answer draft checks
submit confirmation checks
result screen checks
unsupported item fallback checks
error/retry checks
LocalDemoJson checks
provider DTO checks

Run Edit Mode or Play Mode tests when they exist or when the change introduces testable logic.

Every completion report must include:

selected phase or unit
files changed
assets changed
existing UI/assets reused
new UI/assets created
tests/checks run
exact results
Console warnings/errors
deferred items
remaining gaps
next recommended unit

Stop after the selected scope. Do not continue into unrequested quiz units, gameplay missions, rewards shop, or inventory.
